{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"散治法 - 标签","description":"这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。","home_page_url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","language":"zh-CN","icon":"https://acuherb.xyz/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://acuherb.xyz/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.png"}],"items":[{"title":"散治法：论散郁","date_published":"2026-06-05T18:56:52&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-06-05T18:59:52&#43;08:00","id":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-15-sanzhifa/","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-15-sanzhifa/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://gravatar.loli.net/avatar/89719985bb81a6f9d508808413f1b999?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["散治法","散郁"],"summary":"本节为《石室秘录》“散治法”部分，专论外感风邪、内伤郁结所致诸症的疏解法则。核心思想是：邪郁于中，当以表散开郁为主。散中有补，补中寓散，使郁解气行而不伤正气。","content_html":"本节为《石室秘录》“散治法”部分，专论\u003cstrong\u003e外感风邪、内伤郁结\u003c/strong\u003e所致诸症的疏解法则。核心思想是：\u003cstrong\u003e邪郁于中，当以表散开郁为主。散中有补，补中寓散，使郁解气行而不伤正气\u003c/strong\u003e。"}]}